# The generated instructions say whose word wins, the human in the conversation, then the team, then
# aw, and the two routes: alone in a lane with a handoff, or with the human in a pair session.
# req: R60 R78
# source: plans/dogfood-0.3.md 5.8 (docs/spec/sessions.md, "Routes and precedence")
# milestone: M12

workspace solo --single --init
owner-may-change
exec aw setup
grep 'What the human tells you in the conversation comes first, then the team''s instructions, then aw''s.' AGENTS.md
grep 'In a pair session, which only the human grants' AGENTS.md
grep 'bin/aw move-to-lane' AGENTS.md
grep 'bin/aw detach' AGENTS.md
